      "source": "BESM 4th Edition Core Rulebook (Chapter 5)",
      "fullDescription": "Attribute Cost: 1 Point/Level\nRelevant Stat: —\nMelee Defence is a group of that represents expertise in defensive close combat weapons and fighting techniques. These can be taken multiple times to represent different ways of defending. For each Level, the character gains a +2 bonus to their Defence Combat Value whenever they are using the specified fighting technique. The class of weapons may be Unarmed (all normal punches, kicks, bites, etc.) or a class of related Items (such as Axe, Baton/Club, Knife, Polearm, Shield, Spear, Sword, Whips/Chains, etc.). The GM may allow other classes of weapons, although they should not be overly broad.\nLevel 1 Defence Combat Value increases by 2\nwhen using a specific technique\nLevel 2 Defence Combat Value increases by 4\nwhen using a specific technique\nLevel 3 Defence Combat Value increases by 6\nwhen using a specific technique\nLevel 4 Defence Combat Value increases by 8\nwhen using a specific technique\nLevel 5 Defence Combat Value increases by 10\nwhen using a specific technique\nLevel 6 Defence Combat Value increases by 12\nwhen using a specific technique",
