        "Level 0 Weapon with the Stun Enhancement and Non-Penetrating Limiter. Consequently, the damage inflicted upon a successful unarmed attack is simply equal to the character’s Attack Combat Value (page 169). An exception to this guideline applies to characters with the Superstrength Attribute (page 124), since such powerful characters also gain +5 damage to their unarmed attacks for each Level of Superstrength.",
