      "fullDescription": "Multi-Genre Cost: 1 Point/Level\nRelevant Stat: Mind\nSpecialisations: Archaeology, Anthropology,\nCommunication, Education, Politics, Psychology, Social Work, Sociology Understanding of the way populations and individual people function in and contribute to society, as well as larger societal behavioural patterns. SPORTS SPORTS\nMulti-Genre Cost: 1 Point/Level\nRelevant Stat: Body (sometimes Mind or Soul)\nSpecialisations: One specific sport\nThe ability to play well with others in a team or individual sporting event with specialised rules, in a manner that minimises associated injury risks."
