      "fullDescription": "ATHLETICS (SPORTS)\nSkill Group: Adventuring (ACTION)\nRelevant Stat: Body\nCost: 1 Character Point per Rank (Constituent Skill)\nSpecialisations: Baseball, Basketball, Football, Martial Competitions, Soccer, Track and Field\nSource: BESM 4E Core Rulebook & BESM Extras\n\nOrganized competitive sports, track and field, throwing accuracy, and physical contests.\n\nSpecialisations & Fields of Study:\nBaseball, Basketball, Football, Martial Competitions, Soccer, Track and Field\n\nIn play, the character adds their Skill Rank (+1 to +6) to their Body Stat roll whenever attempting checks within this discipline."
