      "fullDescription": "Skill Group: Adventuring (ACTION)\nRelevant Stat: Body\nCost: 1 Character Point per Rank (Constituent Skill)\nSpecialisations: Commercial, Deep-Sea Diving, Free-Diving, Scuba, Snorkeling\nSource: BESM 4E Core Rulebook & BESM Extras\n\nScuba diving, pressurized deep ocean exploration, decompression safety, and underwater work.\n\nSpecialisations & Fields of Study:\nCommercial, Deep-Sea Diving, Free-Diving, Scuba, Snorkeling\n\nIn play, the character adds their Skill Rank (+1 to +6) to their Body Stat roll whenever attempting checks within this discipline."
