      "specialisations": "Aquabatics, Competition, Deep-Sea Diving, Free-Diving, Recreational, Lifesaving",
      "source": "BESM Extras (Chapter 2: Skills)",
      "fullDescription": "Multi-Genre Cost: 1 Point/Level\nRelevant Stat: Body\nSpecialisations: Aquabatics, Competition, Deep-Sea\nDiving, Free Diving, Recreational, Scuba, Snorkelling The character is skilled at swimming or diving. The GM may assume that any character in a modern setting can swim even without this Skill. A swimmer can usually move at a speed equal to their Body Stat in kilometres per hour for short distances."
