      "source": "BESM 4E Core Rulebook & BESM Extras",
      "fullDescription": "Skill Group: Detective (ACTION)\nRelevant Stat: Mind\nCost: 1 Character Point per Rank (Constituent Skill)\nSpecialisations: Ballistics, Biological Evidence, Chemical Analysis, Digital Forensics, Toxicology\nSource: BESM 4E Core Rulebook & BESM Extras\n\nProcessing crime scenes, blood spatter analysis, fingerprint lifting, and ballistic striations.\n\nSpecialisations & Fields of Study:\nBallistics, Biological Evidence, Chemical Analysis, Digital Forensics, Toxicology\n\nIn play, the character adds their Skill Rank (+1 to +6) to their Mind Stat roll whenever attempting checks within this discipline."
